  "body": "Title & CCC Issued – Move In Ready. Act Fast!\r\n\r\nExperience the very best of Auckland’s sun-soaked East Coast lifestyle, where beautiful beaches, lush greenery, and a relaxed coastal atmosphere create an exceptional living environment.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new, high-quality home by a reputable local developer showcases modern design, premium materials, and thoughtful craftsmanship throughout. Offering four spacious bedrooms and three bathrooms (including two ensuites), plus a guest powder room, the layout is ideal for families or multi-generational living.\r\n\r\nNatural timber and stone finishes create a warm, sophisticated feel, while full central air conditioning ensures year-round comfort. The open-plan living area and designer kitchen with ample storage seamlessly connect to a fully fenced, sun-drenched deck and beautifully landscaped garden, creating the perfect setting for entertaining, relaxing, or enjoying family time outdoors. Floor-to-ceiling windows fill the home with natural light, enhancing the sense of space and comfort.\r\n\r\nSmart home features—including lighting, CCTV, doorbell, and remote garage control—provide modern convenience and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nLocated just a short walk to Campbells Bay Beach, cafés, parks, and transport, this home also sits within sought-after school zones, including Rangitoto College, Westlake Girls’ and Boys’ High Schools, Campbells Bay Primary, and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\nPerfect for families or those looking to downsize without compromising on quality or location, this is a rare opportunity in one of the North Shore’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
